            "text": "<p>Sample quotes to show the layout. Replace them with your runners’ own words.</p>"
          }
        },
        "testimonial_1": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "quote": "<p>I had started couch to 5K three times and quit three times. This was the first plan that told me why the slow runs mattered, so I actually did them.</p>",
            "rating": 5,
            "name": "Sample name",
            "role": "First half marathon at 41"
          }
        },
        "testimonial_2": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "quote": "<p>Missing week seven with a cold felt like the end. The Sunday video told me exactly how to pick it back up, and I lost nothing.</p>",
            "rating": 5,
            "name": "Sample name",
            "role": "Nurse, runs before shifts"
          }
        },
        "testimonial_3": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "quote": "<p>The race week checklist is the best page in the course. I knew what to eat, what to wear and when to set off.</p>",
            "rating": 5,
            "name": "Sample name",
            "role": "Finished smiling"
          }
        },
        "testimonial_4": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "quote": "<p>Four runs a week sounded like a lot. Three of them are short, and the long one became my favourite hour of the week.</p>",
            "rating": 5,
            "name": "Sample name",
            "role": "Father of two"
          }
        },
        "testimonial_5": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "quote": "<p>I am slow and I will stay slow. Nobody in the course minds, and the plan never made me feel like I was behind.</p>",
            "rating": 5,
            "name": "Sample name",
            "role": "Started at 58"
          }
        }
      },
